# 📁 三、.rags 文件设计（核心）

这是你系统的“控制平面”。

建议结构：

```yaml id="config_1"
project: novel_a

paths:
  - ./novel
  - ./notes

exclude:
  - .git
  - node_modules

db:
  type: qdrant
  url: http://localhost:6333
  collection: rags_novel_a

embedding:
  provider: siliconflow
  model: bge-m3
  api_key: xxx

rerank:
  provider: siliconflow
  model: bge-reranker-large

index:
  chunk_size: 800
  overlap: 150

features:
  store_line_number: true
  store_context_window: true
```

---

# 🧩 四、核心数据模型（非常关键）

每个 chunk 存入 Qdrant：

```json id="point_schema"
{
  "id": "chunk_id",
  "vector": [...],

  "payload": {
    "project": "novel_a",

    "file_path": "novel/第15章.txt",
    "file_hash": "abc123",

    "start_line": 120,
    "end_line": 145,

    "chunk_index": 3,

    "text": "后悔值结算：顾景修+4..."
  }
}
```

